l` · `@deepseek-ai/dsh-invariants` |\n| Skill name | `7d-code-reviewer` |\n| Repo"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"sitory | github.com/7dgroup-ai/dsh-skill-7d-code-reviewer |\n| License | MIT |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 🖼️ Plugin Effect"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Skill invocation in a dsh session:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Sample HTML report generated from the pure-placeholder template:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Core Capabilities**:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **Template-driven mode** — separation of concerns: `SKILL.md` decides what to review and how sever"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"e it is, `templates/` only presents. The HTML report template stays pure placeholders; all placehold"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ers must be filled, and every dynamic value is HTML-escaped.\n- **Five-step review flow** — accept th"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"e task → quick scan → line-by-line review (loading `references/` on demand) → severity grading → rep"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"ort generation.\n- **Three-level severity grading** — 🔴 critical (must fix) / 🟡 medium (should fix) /"},{"id":"p13s6","text":" 🟢 minor (optional polish).\n- **Four-dimension scoring** — code quality / security / performance / m"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"aintainability, each on a 1–10 scale, plus an overall score and an auto-generated summary.\n- **Dual "},{"id":"p13s8","text":"output** — a text summary for quick reading, plus a full HTML report saved as `code-review-report-{t"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"imestamp}.html`.\n- **Built-in knowledge base** — coding standards, security checklist (SQL injection"},{"id":"p13s10","text":", XSS, authentication/authorization, sensitive-data leaks) and worked review examples, loaded on dem"},{"id":"p13s11","text":"and instead of bloating the prompt.\n- **Zero core changes** — pure composable bundle; no patches to "},{"id":"p13s12","text":"the DSH core, safe to install and remove."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**Use Cases**:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- Code review before commit / merge request\n- Security audit of 