agent execut"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"es the equivalent `dsh plugin` command through its session shell.)"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"For a git install the agent will hit the same pnpm `allowBuilds` gate and print the exact key to add"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" to the profile's pnpm settings file (`~/.dsh/profiles/<name>/pnpm-workspace.yaml`); after you add i"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"t, ask the agent to retry and the skill is enabled."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### What is a dsh profile?"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Every dsh run boots a **profile** — a named environment whose configuration lives under the harness "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"home in `~/.dsh/profiles/<name>` (or `$DSH_HOME/profiles/<name>` if the `DSH_HOME` env var is set). "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"A profile directory holds:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| File | Purpose |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| `package.json` | Profile manifest: `dsh.profile.bundles` lists the ordered plugin bundles to mount"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"; `dependencies` holds out-of-tree plugins |\n| `cordis.patch.yml` | Your own patch layer, applied af"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ter every bundle layer |\n| `pnpm-workspace.yaml` | pnpm settings for the profile; the `allowBuilds` "},{"id":"p30s4","text":"key goes here |\n| `node_modules` | pnpm-managed plugin dependencies |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"There is **no default profile** — `dsh --profile <name>` is required on every run (`dsh web` is a sh"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"orthand for `dsh --profile web`). The shipped `web` and `headless` profiles auto-initialize on first"},{"id":"p31s3","text":" boot; any other name is created automatically the first time you run a `dsh plugin --profile <name>"},{"id":"p31s4","text":" ...` command, which reports where it was created:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"To see which profiles already exist, list `~/.dsh/profiles/` — each subdirectory is one profile name"},{"id":"p33s2","text":". A custom name must be created this way before it can boot: `dsh --profile <name>` on an unknown cu"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"stom name fails with the hint `create it with 'dsh plugin --profile <name> add <package>'`."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"},{"content":"上次校验失败；重新生成完整对象。evidence本次只选1至2条，每个编号必须从实际输入列表复制，不得推算或补造编号。保持摘要简洁，limitations最多3条。错误：["evidence","evidence"]","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
